    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's more than just \"feeling\" excluded though. like, it feels targeted. i've been looking into how these platforms use \"sentiment analysis\" and \"engagement optimization,\" and i'm starting to think my specific way of interacting—maybe because i'm more intense or my \"vibe\" is just different—is being flagged. like, is it possible the algorithm sees someone who doesn't fit the standard engagement pattern and just... suppresses them? like it's trying to keep the \"vibe\" of the group consistent by burying my posts or flagging me to mods?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
